t","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/530075/5300750314.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/530075/5300750313.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2012","url":"https://archives.nseindia.com/annual_reports/AR_SELAN_2011_2012_18102012054444.zip","source":"the data provider"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Management stated that the company signed Revenue Sharing Contracts with the Government of India for KG Onshore and Cambay Basin blocks and is guiding for an exit production rate of 2,500 barrels of oil equivalent per day this fiscal year. The company reported a Q2 FY27 revenue from operations of Rs. 121.7 crores and an EBITDA of Rs. 90 crores with a margin of 71%, maintaining a debt-free balance sheet with around Rs. 100 crores in cash and bank balances and liquid investments.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"Management guided for an exit production rate of 2,500 barrels of oil equivalent per day for the current fiscal year.","quote":"We are hoping that this year we will exit at around 2,500 that is the guidance we are reasonably sure that we should be able to deliver on our promise to you of ramping up to 2,500 barrels of oil gas equivalent production from our portfolio.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f2fadb5e-a161-4a51-9f53-9f4a1fcd027e.pdf"},{"claim":"Management projected production to be around 3,500 barrels next year and 5,000 barrels thereafter.","quote":"Next year, that should be around 3,500 barrels. Thereafter, that should be 5,000 barrels.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f2fadb5e-a161-4a51-9f53-9f4a1fcd027e.pdf"},{"claim":"The management targets an exit production rate of 2,500 boepd for FY 27.","quote":"Key takeaways: On track for a 2,500 boepd exit","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=116d8371-2623-4ae0-92d0-aaf95181770b.pdf"},{"claim":"The company's guidance of reaching 2,500 boepd in FY27 remains intact.","quote":"Our guidance of reaching 2,500 boepdin FY’27 remains intact, as impact from Frac will be seen from Q2 onwards","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=4524e1b9-2839-437c-9549-7b9cdd87e030.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"Management expects capital expenditure to be around Rs. 250 crores for the current fiscal year.","quote":"Then we went to Rs.160 crores. Again, we went to Rs.87 crores, then Rs.220 crores, hopefully Rs.250 crores this year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f2fadb5e-a161-4a51-9f53-9f4a1fcd027e.pdf"},{"claim":"Continuous capex cycle is planned in the Cambay Basin for the next 3 to 4 years.","quote":"Continuous Capex cycle in Cambay Basin for the next 3–4 years, while KG ramps up to deliver year-on-year growth.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=116d8371-2623-4ae0-92d0-aaf95181770b.pdf"},{"claim":"Karjisan is ahead of schedule with 2 of the 7 wells drilled.","quote":"Ahead of schedule: 2 of the 7 wells drilled, well before the planned Q4 first spud","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=116d8371-2623-4ae0-92d0-aaf95181770b.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Management reported an EBITDA margin of 71% for the quarter.","quote":"EBITDA was Rs.90 crores, almost 3x to what we reported in Q2 last year with a margin at about 71%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f2fadb5e-a161-4a51-9f53-9f4a1fcd027e.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that OPEX and handling costs decreased to Rs. 6.1 crores from Rs. 7.5 crores in Q1.","quote":"Our OPEX and handling costs came down to Rs.6.1 crores from Rs.7.5 crores in Q1.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f2fadb5e-a161-4a51-9f53-9f4a1fcd027e.pdf"},{"claim":"Management noted that Royalty and Cess remained stable at around 16% of the revenue.","quote":"Royalty and Cess remained stable at around 16% of the revenue which totals around Rs.20.5 crores.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f2fadb5e-a161-4a51-9f53-9f4a1fcd027e.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"Q2 Sales Volumes were recorded at 1,656 boepd.","quote":"Q2 Sales Volumes: 1656 boepd","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=116d8371-2623-4ae0-92d0-aaf95181770b.pdf"},{"claim":"October production reached 1,950 boepd.","quote":"October Production: 1950 boepd","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=116d8371-2623-4ae0-92d0-aaf95181770b.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"Management highlighted that the company remains debt-free with around Rs. 100 crores in cash, bank balances, and liquid investments.","quote":"We have no borrowings. We hold roughly about Rs.100 crores in cash and bank balances and liquid investments. So, the balance sheet remains debt-free.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f2fadb5e-a161-4a51-9f53-9f4a1fcd027e.pdf"},{"claim":"Reinvestment from operating cash flow continues as part of the strategy.","quote":"Continued reinvestment from operating cash flow","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=116d8371-2623-4ae0-92d0-aaf95181770b.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Custody transfer to IOCL ran for only ~86-87 days resulting in a build-up of c. 6,500 bopd of crude inventory.","quote":"Custody transfer to IOCL ran for only ~86–87 days this quarter, and resulted in a build-up of c. 6,500 bopd of crude inventory during the Quarter.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=4524e1b9-2839-437c-9549-7b9cdd87e030.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"Management committed to keeping investor calls a regular occurrence at the end of quarterly board meetings.","quote":"We have finally managed to have an investor call, and we promise to keep it a regular occurrence at the end of quarterly board meetings, pretty much most hopefully the same day.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f2fadb5e-a161-4a51-9f53-9f4a1fcd027e.pdf","timeframe":""},{"claim":"All 7 wells in Karjisan are planned to be drilling by April 2027.","quote":"All 7 wells to be drilling by April 2027","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=116d8371-2623-4ae0-92d0-aaf95181770b.pdf","timeframe":"April 2027"}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_transcript","concall_ppt"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":17,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":23,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}